{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2022-01-27 08:31:00', 'title': "DUKE ENERGY'S SOLAR PORTFOLIO GROWS IN NORTH CAROLINA WITH THE ADDITION OF TWO NEW PLANTS", 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., JAN. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CONTINUING ITS EFFORTS TO GROW RENEWABLE ENERGY IN NORTH CAROLINA, DUKE ENERGY SUSTAINABLE SOLUTIONS, A NONREGULATED COMMERCIAL BRAND OF DUKE ENERGY (NYSE: DUK), RECENTLY BEGAN COMMERCIAL OPERATION OF TWO MAJOR SOLAR FACILITIES IN THE STATE.'}